  "description": "New to the rental market comes this impressive four bedroom property.  Located in a small friendly development within walking distance of all amenities.  Only a short drive to Castlerea or Roscommon.  The property offers off street parking, private rear garden.  Oil fired central heating with open fireplace.\n\nAccommodation consists of: entrance hallway with stairs to sleeping accommodation.  Large sitting room with front aspect window and open fireplace.  Open plan kitchen, dining and living area with ample storage and worktop space, separate utility with rear access and guest wc.\n\nUpstairs offers spacious landing, shelved hotpress.   Three double bedrooms with one single bedroom.  Ensuite off master bedroom.  Family sized bathroom.  This property is fully furnished and nicely presented.  For further information or to arrange viewing please email your interest.\n\nNo pets please.  References required.\n\n",
